WAV2VIC README
==============

About

    * wav2vic - A utility that converts C2N tape data stored in .wav files to Vic-20 data files.

Compiling 

    * The following used to work back in 2006 with the Visual Studio or GNU gcc C compiler.
    * % cc -o wav2vic wav2vic.c

Installing

    * No installation method has been provided.

Package

    * No packaging method has been provided.

Testing

    * No test harness has been provided.

Running

    * Refer to the main documentation.

Main Documentation

    * Refer to the doc/wav2vic.html file inside this repository.

